			(property "Description" "XL7046 1.0A 100KHz 90V Buck DC to DC Converter\n\nGeneral Description The XL7046 is a 100KHz fixed frequency PWM buck (step-down) DC/DC converter, capable of driving a 1.0A load with high efficiency, low ripple and excellent line and load regulation. Requiring a minimum number of external components, the regulator is simple to use and include internal frequency compensation and a fixed-frequency oscillator.   Datasheet"
